@dsh-external/dsh-turbo-agent README · Runtime data：`%USERPROFILE%\.dsh\turbo-agent` contains the non-secret YAML configuration,
managed PID metadata, TurboAgent traces, and logs.

The visualizer is available locally at <http://127.0.0.1:18888/visualizer>.

@dsh-external/dsh-turbo-agent README · Upstream licenses：This integration is MIT licensed. TurboAgent is Apache-2.0 licensed;
LLM-as-a-Verifier is MIT licensed. They are installed as Python dependencies
and are not vendored into this repository.
